-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":165616519,"discussion_id":"65aa7203d984326b440bada45bd2b317a9e77c75","body":"## 问题/功能描述\n\n本次PR旨在修复CTC损失函数梯度计算算子（CTCLossV2Grad）在初始化阶段存在的两个关键问题。首先，原代码使用硬编码的索引值来读取属性，导致代码可读性和可维护性较差。其次，代码错误地将布尔类型的`zero_infinity`属性当作`int64_t`类型进行读取，存在潜在的类型转换错误和未定义行为的风险。\n\n## 修改方案描述\n\n修改方案通过引入具名常量来替代硬编码的索引值，从而提升代码的清晰度和可维护性。具体而言，定义了`ATTR_BLANK_IDX`和`ATTR_ZERO_INFINITY_IDX`两个常量来分别表示相关属性在列表中的索引。在`Init`函数中，使用这些常量获取属性指针，并将`zero_infinity`属性的读取类型从`int64_t`更正为`bool`，然后将其值正确转换为整数存储，确保了属性读取的类型安全性和逻辑正确性。","created_at":"2026-03-18T14:13:23+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-18T14:13:23+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":165617635,"discussion_id":"8dcc0608160395f7474e8c56bf573cb9fdc1ac35","body":"compile","created_at":"2026-03-18T14:19:24+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-18T14:19:24+08:00","user":{"id":"687f2bc30b80e6291e8a317f","login":"wkx12138","object_id":"687f2bc30b80e6291e8a317f","name":"wkx12138","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/wkx12138"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":165617813,"discussion_id":"2aab12fdefbe7cac2482d4008da22d1a8ca94676","body":"流水线任务触发成功\n任务链接 [<b><a href='https://www.openlibing.com/apps/pipelineDetail?pipelineId=b582e6c0e2c54a3f8168601c5b292c24&pipelineRunId=52bec7b989d44057be619ca4ad9c6a7e&projectName=CANN'>52bec7b989d44057be619ca4ad9c6a7e</a></b>][<b><a href='https://gitcode.com/cann/infrastructure/blob/main/docs/ci/ci_guide.md'>流水线指导</a></b>]\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse\"><tr><th>任